        },
        "hook-text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Lauric acid disrupts odor-causing bacteria. Baking soda raises underarm pH so they can't thrive. Jojoba carries the actives in and absorbs without trapping bacteria against skin.<\/p>",
